#~ "double. Chaque valeur est accompagnée de"
#~ " son intervalle à 95 %, calculé "
#~ "en rééchantillonnant les parties du "
#~ "match (ou les matchs d'un agrégat). "
#~ "Il faut au moins deux parties, ou"
#~ " deux matchs, pour qu'un intervalle "
#~ "existe. Ne classez pas des joueurs "
#~ "sur un seul match."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "A single match is very noisy: a"
#~ " few big errors are enough to "
#~ "make it vary by a factor of "
#~ "two. Each value comes with its 95%"
#~ " interval, computed by resampling the "
#~ "match's games (or the matches of "
#~ "an aggregate). At least two games, "
#~ "or two matches, are needed for an"
#~ " interval to exist. Do not rank "
#~ "players on a single match."

